<p>Cisco IOS 12.2(55)SE12 · 12.2(55)SE12</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\\"euiText euiText--extraSmall vmCveDesc\\">
<p>Multiple stack-based buffer overflows in Command EXEC in Cisco IOS allow local users to gain privileges via unspecified vectors, aka (1) PSIRT-0474975756 and (2) PSIRT-0388256465.  NOTE: as of 20071016, the only disclosure is a vague pre-advisory with no actionable information.  However, since it is from a well-known researcher, it is being assigned a CVE identifier for tracking purposes.</p>
</div>
</div>
