<div class=\\"euiTextColor euiTextColor--subdued\\">
<p>Cisco IOS 12.2(55)SE12 · 12.2(55)SE12</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\\"euiText euiText--extraSmall vmCveDesc\\">
<p>The Data-link Switching (DLSw) feature in Cisco IOS 11.0 through 12.4 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (device reload) via \\"an invalid value in a DLSw message... during the capabilities exchange.\\"</p>
</div>
</div>
